1
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:14,440
How did you find out
about your mom's illness?

2
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:15,320
One day,

3
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:17,600
she came home so tired
that she fell asleep.

4
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:18,920
Her medicine was right on the table.

5
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:20,050
I looked it up online

6
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:21,490
and found out

7
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:24,370
she has the same illness as my grandma.

8
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:27,360
Actually, your mom is doing pretty well.

9
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:28,440
Don't worry.

10
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,920
She didn't mean to hide it from you.

11
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:33,320
She just cares about you too much

12
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:35,200
and didn't want to affect your studies.

13
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,400
That's why she kept it a secret.

14
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,960
But that's exactly what's wrong.

15
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:39,120
I'm grown up now,

16
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:41,400
but she still treats me like a kid.

17
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:42,200
I'm a man.

18
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:43,400
I can protect her now.

19
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,400
She just shut me out

20
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:46,880
and wouldn't tell me anything.

21
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:48,800
You really misunderstood her on this.

22
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:50,400
She's not what you think.

23
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:53,530
Chengcheng,

24
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:55,360
we need

25
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:57,840
to understand our parents too.

26
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:58,880
As parents,

27
00:00:58,880 --> 00:01:00,610
they sometimes have no choice.

28
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:02,760
Actually,

29
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:03,800
I get all that.

30
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:05,239
She wants what's best for me,

31
00:01:05,239 --> 00:01:06,900
and I want what's best for her.

32
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,080
But it's also true

33
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:09,930
that I feel wronged.

34
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:12,660
Well, that's just how a lot of things are.

35
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:15,280
It's because we care
about each other too much

36
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:16,960
that we hold ourselves back.

37
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:17,800
In the end,

38
00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:20,690
we hurt each other
without even realizing it.

39
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:26,810
What is it

40
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:28,539
that you have to say in person?

41
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:31,200
Chengcheng just called me.

42
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:34,370
He asked about your health.

43
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:37,600
Don't worry,

44
00:01:38,479 --> 00:01:39,740
I didn't say anything.

45
00:01:41,360 --> 00:01:42,039
Yishan,

46
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:43,680
I suggest you talk to the kid

47
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,810
as soon as possible.

48
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:46,090
I think he might have

49
00:01:47,160 --> 00:01:48,360
found out something.

50
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:50,200
Otherwise, he wouldn't have

51
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,130
called to ask me.

52
00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:52,580
What did he ask?

53
00:01:56,440 --> 00:01:57,039
He just asked

54
00:01:57,039 --> 00:01:58,360
how you've been feeling lately,

55
00:01:58,360 --> 00:01:59,240
if you're taking any medicine,

56
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:00,040
and what kind.

57
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:01,360
He asked if you're handling

58
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:02,800
the overtime well.

59
00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:04,380
I think the kid just

60
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,130
cares about you.

61
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:07,720
So...

62
00:02:08,479 --> 00:02:09,880
We've talked about this.

63
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:14,320
I'll handle it myself.

64
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:15,320
I have my own pace.

65
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:17,490
I hope you don't disrupt it.

66
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:19,840
Okay.

67
00:02:20,760 --> 00:02:21,890
As for your parents,

68
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:23,800
if possible,

69
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:26,090
could you help me...

70
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,450
Don't worry about that.

71
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:29,200
I've already talked to them.

72
00:02:29,760 --> 00:02:31,420
They won't cause any trouble.

73
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:33,320
Thank you.

74
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:40,700
Actually, I didn't mean
to hide it from Chengcheng.

75
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:42,840
I just think the timing isn't right.

76
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:43,880
I want

77
00:02:44,320 --> 00:02:46,079
to wait until after
his high school entrance exam.

78
00:02:46,079 --> 00:02:46,880
By then,

79
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:48,880
my body should be mostly recovered.

80
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:51,300
He should be more accepting of it.

81
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:54,240
You always think things through

82
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:55,700
more thoroughly than I do.

83
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:57,360
I respect your decision.

84
00:03:17,200 --> 00:03:18,260
I'll have a skewer.

85
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:25,400
How are your grilling skills?

86
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:26,460
Don't worry, miss.

87
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:27,440
I'm the best griller

88
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:28,560
around.

89
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:30,290
If it's not good, it's free.

90
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:31,520
You're pretty funny.

91
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,890
Grill me your specialties.

92
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:35,120
Sure.

93
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,730
Is this thing you mentioned legit?

94
00:03:41,600 --> 00:03:43,360
It sounds a bit sketchy.

95
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:44,600
Come on,

96
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:47,610
my connections are absolutely solid.

97
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,200
Right?

98
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,400
Otherwise,

99
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:51,329
would I call you this late at night?

100
00:03:52,320 --> 00:03:52,960
Listen,

101
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:54,120
let me tell you.

102
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,800
This is an investment project

103
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,200
from a branch of

104
00:03:57,200 --> 00:03:59,200
the International Energy Exchange.

105
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:00,320
It's a sure thing.

106
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:03,840
And you know what?

107
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:05,480
The earlier you get in,

108
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:06,520
the faster

109
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,520
and more you earn.

110
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:08,080
Got it?

111
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:10,360
I don't understand

112
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,960
this Zhongyuan

113
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,240
Dongyou stuff.

114
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:15,600
You don't, but I do.

115
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:16,959
I'm your own brother.

116
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,040
Would I lie

117
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:18,440
to you?

118
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:20,920
Alright,

119
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:22,840
I'll trust you this once.

120
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:25,930
I'll transfer the money to you in a bit.

121
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:28,160
That's my sister.

122
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:29,050
So generous.

123
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:31,660
Just wait for me to make you a fortune.

124
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:57,920
Wei,

125
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,340
have you eaten?

126
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:01,480
I was so busy I forgot.

127
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:03,680
Were you just going to starve

128
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:05,140
if I didn't bring you food?

129
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,450
Stop working

130
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:06,960
and eat.

131
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:09,490
Where is Kaixin?

132
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,200
She probably went out.

133
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:12,260
She's not back yet.

134
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:15,730
What are you searching for?

135
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:18,880
Doesn't Shen Shuyue have
a purchase history of sleeping pills?

136
00:05:18,880 --> 00:05:21,080
The diazepam in Luan Pingping's body

137
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:23,000
should match her medication.

138
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,600
I just can't figure out what it is.

139
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:28,600
There's no mention of this

140
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:30,160
in the previous medical records either.

141
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,360
I looked up this drug.

142
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:32,480
It's a synthetic

143
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:34,120
androgen.

144
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:36,920
It promotes the development
of male sexual organs,

145
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:37,600
but at the same time,

146
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,000
it inhibits bone growth.

147
00:05:39,520 --> 00:05:40,520
Some parents of child models

148
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:42,440
give this to their kids

149
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:44,280
to keep them from growing up,

150
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,600
just to secure their income.

151
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,659
Then I have a guess.

152
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:49,850
Shen Shuyue used to treat
Luan Pingping as a cash cow,

153
00:05:49,960 --> 00:05:52,320
mostly just exploiting him.

154
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:54,040
After Luan Keguang left,

155
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:56,200
could she have transferred her hatred

156
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:57,560
onto Luan Pingping?

157
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:01,720
Yishan,

158
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,560
you're here too.

159
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,280
You're back.

160
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:05,540
Just in time, I brought you a little gift.

161
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:07,720
Thanks.

162
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:10,480
All right,

163
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:12,280
stop working on that for now.

164
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,400
What are you guys looking at?

165
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:15,920
We're looking into

166
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:17,820
Luan Keguang and Shen Shuyue.

167
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:19,760
Their only common interest

168
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:21,360
is the child model business.

169
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,280
So I believe

170
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,200
Luan Keguang is aware of it.

171
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:24,880
How about this?

172
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:26,000
We'll share this information
with the police

173
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:28,080
tomorrow at work.

174
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:29,720
If that's really the case,

175
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:30,880
there's an

176
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:32,640
illegal industry chain involved.

177
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:33,320
All right,

178
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:34,680
look how tired you are.

179
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:35,280
Eat first.

180
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:42,650
Isn't this Shen Shuyue?

181
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:43,840
Look,

182
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:46,730
is this Shen Shuyue?

183
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,820
She was there that day too.

184
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:53,960
Rewind it.

185
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:57,620
She wasn't just there.

186
00:06:58,440 --> 00:06:59,440
Look at her shoes.

187
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:04,760
These are the shoes

188
00:07:04,760 --> 00:07:06,620
Pengpeng identified Ling Wei by.

189
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:09,880
It's highly likely that Shen Shuyue

190
00:07:09,880 --> 00:07:11,610
was the one who locked Pengpeng

191
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:13,160
in the bathroom that day.

192
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,160
Pingping,

193
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,240
take this yogurt

194
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:17,160
to Pengpeng.

195
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:26,720
Look at me.

196
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:29,600
Make a peace sign.

197
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,840
Perfect.

198
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:33,760
Right.

199
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:34,880
That's it.

200
00:07:37,080 --> 00:07:38,680
What's wrong with Pengpeng?

201
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:39,360
W-What's

202
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,440
going on here?

203
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:41,560
Sorry,

204
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:43,400
let me give him a moment.

205
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:44,800
Can we still shoot today?

206
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:46,159
We can.

207
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:46,980
Look at him.

208
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:48,250
Here we go again.

209
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:48,920
Lady,

210
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:50,320
your son is already eight.

211
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:51,120
Stop causing trouble,

212
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:51,520
okay?

213
00:07:51,520 --> 00:07:52,180
We're busy.

214
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:52,440
No,

215
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:53,120
he's not tall.

216
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:53,600
Look at him.

217
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:54,600
His height is fine.

218
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,159
Not tall enough won't work.

219
00:07:56,400 --> 00:07:57,400
Don't you know

220
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:58,860
how he looks on camera now?

221
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:00,120
I remember back then,

222
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:03,200
Shen Shuyue insisted on bringing
the kid to make a scene.

223
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:04,080
I was wondering

224
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:06,320
why she had to pull a stunt like that.

225
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,340
Now it seems...

226
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,040
Shen Shuyue

227
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,820
hurt Pengpeng on purpose.

228
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,160
That must be it.

229
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:19,700
After Pingping's looks changed,

230
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:20,800
Pengpeng

231
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:22,640
took over his job offers.

232
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:24,320
She must be holding a grudge

233
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:26,120
against our kid because of this.

234
00:08:26,320 --> 00:08:28,400
Is Pengpeng still working
as a child model?

235
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:30,460
We stopped putting him through that.

236
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,400
This industry is just exhausting.

237
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:33,880
Shooting winter clothes in summer

238
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:35,360
and summer clothes in winter.

239
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,320
He had to change into

240
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:38,280
over 100 outfits a day for photoshoots

241
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:39,409
and stay energetic.

242
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:43,080
It was just too hard on the kid.

243
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:46,960
Hey kiddo,

244
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,640
do you still remember

245
00:08:48,640 --> 00:08:49,240
Pingping?

246
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:52,600
Pingping is so pitiful.

247
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:54,280
Pitiful?

248
00:08:54,880 --> 00:08:55,360
Why?

249
00:08:55,880 --> 00:08:58,410
Because Pingping can't
grow taller anymore.

250
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:05,800
There's an unwritten rule
in the child modeling industry

251
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:08,530
that only kids under 1.2 meters
can get good jobs.

252
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,720
I've heard before

253
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:12,360
that some cruel parents

254
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:13,880
would give their kids injections and pills

255
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:15,080
to stop their growth.

256
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:17,760
But I didn't expect anyone
to actually do it.

257
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:19,090
This is too terrifying.

258
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,560
Is it the kind of medicine

259
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:21,420
with hormones?

260
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:23,280
Yeah, the kind

261
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,480
that controls development

262
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:26,120
and stops them from growing taller.

263
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:27,920
Do you know where they bought it?

264
00:09:28,280 --> 00:09:29,040
I heard

265
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:31,680
they usually contact them by phone.

266
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:35,160
What's wrong?

267
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,520
Dr. Zhang, who sells controlled drugs,

268
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:38,880
has been arrested by the police.

269
00:09:38,880 --> 00:09:39,640
Shen Shuyue's medicine

270
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:41,040
was also bought from him.

271
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:42,440
According to the interrogation results

272
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:43,720
provided by the police,

273
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:46,000
the parents who came to Dr. Zhang
to buy methyltestosterone

274
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,130
did so voluntarily.

275
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:49,160
This is the interrogation record
provided by the police.

276
00:09:49,160 --> 00:09:49,760
Let me see.

277
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,280
...state the truth and do not commit perjury,
or you will bear the corresponding legal responsibilities. Is that clear?

278
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:54,740
Doctor,

279
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,080
If I take this medicine,

280
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:57,210
will I stop growing?

281
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:57,800
This medicine

282
00:09:57,800 --> 00:10:00,000
can only control

283
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:02,920
the child's height for the next two years.

284
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:05,080
In other words, it slows down
the child's growth.

285
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:05,960
Later on,

286
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,440
it might not work anymore.

287
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,560
However, this medicine

288
00:10:08,560 --> 00:10:09,960
has severe side effects.

289
00:10:10,280 --> 00:10:11,840
As long as he doesn't grow
in the next two years.

290
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:13,500
I don't want to take medicine.

291
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:19,280
Pingping,

292
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:20,160
be a good boy.

293
00:10:20,160 --> 00:10:21,360
You have to behave,

294
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:23,280
or no one will hire you.

295
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:26,890
Why don't you discuss it again?

296
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:28,260
No need.

297
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:29,560
We'll use this medicine.

298
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:30,600
Dr. Zhang,

299
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:31,530
what's going on?

300
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:33,480
The kid threw up as soon as we got back,

301
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:34,520
and he has a recurring low fever.

302
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:36,600
We didn't even dare take him
to the hospital.

303
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:37,840
This is normal.

304
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:39,840
He'll be fine once he gets used to it.

305
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:42,200
When will the red spots
on his face and neck

306
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:43,080
go away?

307
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:45,160
He can't shoot anything like this.

308
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:46,920
Everyone is different.

309
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:49,320
Besides, I told you

310
00:10:49,800 --> 00:10:51,660
there would be some side effects.

311
00:10:51,800 --> 00:10:52,480
You chose to use

312
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:54,080
this medicine voluntarily.

313
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,600
This couple is really something else.

314
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:02,330
Don't be mad.

315
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:03,800
The police are recovering

316
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:05,200
Shen Shuyue's phone data

317
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,800
to see if there are new clues.

318
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:08,280
And it's not just Shen Shuyue.

319
00:11:08,280 --> 00:11:10,080
Luan Keguang is no saint either.

320
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:11,240
Shen Shuyue has always been the one

321
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:13,240
following Luan Pingping's shoots.

322
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:15,320
Luan Keguang habitually
hides in the background.

323
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:15,920
So,

324
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:17,280
he'll most likely blame Shen Shuyue

325
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:19,040
for the medicine incident.

326
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:28,220
Shen Shuyue wants to see us again.

327
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:31,650
Shen Shuyue.

328
00:11:32,160 --> 00:11:33,760
Are you emotionally stable?

329
00:11:34,400 --> 00:11:35,080
I want to know

330
00:11:35,080 --> 00:11:36,560
what

331
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:38,000
Ke Guang told you.

332
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:40,840
He told us about you
abusing Luan Pingping.

333
00:11:41,520 --> 00:11:43,720
And he provided some related evidence.

334
00:11:46,160 --> 00:11:47,420
Did he really say that?

335
00:11:47,680 --> 00:11:48,880
I wouldn't lie to you.

336
00:11:49,280 --> 00:11:51,480
The police are recovering your phone data.

337
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:54,080
It's only a matter of time
before we find clues.

338
00:11:58,160 --> 00:12:00,400
I didn't actually want to kill Pingping.

339
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:01,400
Pingping's death

340
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:03,400
was just an accident.

341
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:03,960
The sleeping pills

342
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:05,160
that caused Luan Pingping's death

343
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:06,560
were found in your house.

344
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:08,160
The missing dosage

345
00:12:08,360 --> 00:12:11,080
matches the amount detected
in Luan Pingping's body.

346
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:13,080
Do you still think it's an accident?

347
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:15,020
Are you still going to deny it?

348
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:18,000
I just wanted to

349
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:20,960
bring Keguang home this way.

350
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:23,180
Be good, Pingping.

351
00:12:23,400 --> 00:12:24,440
Eat this candy,

352
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:26,320
and Daddy will come home.

353
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:33,420
Swallow it.

354
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:35,240
Eat it.

355
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:37,760
Swallow it

356
00:12:38,400 --> 00:12:38,920
down.

357
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:41,820
You wanted to force him
this way, didn't you?

358
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:43,680
To make him come see you.

359
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:44,280
I told you,

360
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:47,280
I didn't want to kill him.

361
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:48,800
Look,

362
00:12:48,920 --> 00:12:49,580
look north.

363
00:12:50,920 --> 00:12:53,050
I just wanted him to get seriously ill.

364
00:12:53,160 --> 00:12:53,890
But Keguang,

365
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:56,720
he doesn't care
if the child lives or dies at all.

366
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:58,180
He only cares about money.

367
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:03,180
You know about
Pingping's insurance money, right?

368
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:04,930
If I can get the 800,000,

369
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:07,080
Keguang will definitely come back.

370
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:09,360
You used this method
to commit insurance fraud.

371
00:13:09,360 --> 00:13:11,290
Did you think we wouldn't find out?

372
00:13:12,200 --> 00:13:12,400
Look.

373
00:13:12,400 --> 00:13:15,000
I almost

374
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:16,200
pulled it off.

375
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:19,960
When did your plan start?

376
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:23,280
Here,

377
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,480
eat this to get some energy.

378
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:24,880
We still have

379
00:13:24,880 --> 00:13:26,280
three sets of outfits to shoot.

380
00:13:26,280 --> 00:13:26,760
Alright,

381
00:13:26,760 --> 00:13:28,280
hurry up and change into the next one.

382
00:13:28,280 --> 00:13:28,680
Hurry.

383
00:13:28,680 --> 00:13:29,340
Take it off.

384
00:13:29,680 --> 00:13:30,740
Put this on, quick.

385
00:13:30,800 --> 00:13:31,640
Put it on yourself.

386
00:13:31,640 --> 00:13:32,280
Hurry up.

387
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:35,040
Hurry up.

388
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:37,560
We have another shoot next.

389
00:13:37,560 --> 00:13:38,200
Hurry up.

390
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,060
Look at the camera.

391
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:41,840
Look at the camera.

392
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:42,240
Quick.

393
00:13:45,400 --> 00:13:46,200
What's wrong?

394
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:49,320
Don't pretend to be sick to slack off.

395
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:49,840
Oh no,

396
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,320
the candy is stuck in the throat.

397
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:52,980
We can't breach the contract.

398
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:59,340
The kid is still young,

399
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:01,530
right at that mischievous age.

400
00:14:02,160 --> 00:14:03,620
He wants to put everything

401
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:05,240
in his mouth.

402
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:08,610
So no one would suspect a thing.

403
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:09,640
Then how do you explain

404
00:14:09,640 --> 00:14:10,120
the pinch marks

405
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:10,980
on his jawline?

406
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:13,380
That was a rescue attempt.

407
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:15,420
I pinched his mouth

408
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:17,640
to force it open.

409
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:19,920
You're talking absolute nonsense.

410
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:21,120
Those marks were left

411
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:22,320
when you force-fed the medicine.

412
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:23,880
So on the day of the crime,

413
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:26,320
you didn't care about
the child's life at all.

414
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:26,760
Yeah,

415
00:14:28,400 --> 00:14:30,660
I didn't expect him to run off by himself.

416
00:14:35,560 --> 00:14:36,090
Keguang,

417
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:37,360
when are you coming back?

418
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:39,020
I'm a bit short on cash lately.

419
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:40,780
Not going back to Beitan City.

420
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:49,360
Tell him to come home.

421
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,320
Dad,

422
00:14:51,880 --> 00:14:54,080
how could you treat the child like this?

423
00:14:54,360 --> 00:14:54,890
Keguang,

424
00:14:55,680 --> 00:14:56,600
do you remember

425
00:14:57,160 --> 00:14:59,090
Pingping has an insurance policy?

426
00:15:01,080 --> 00:15:02,160
Don't be afraid, Pingping.

427
00:15:02,160 --> 00:15:03,820
Dad will come pick you up soon.

428
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:05,600
When are you coming back?

429
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:06,860
I'll go pick you up now.

430
00:15:24,280 --> 00:15:26,120
Did Luan Keguang know about the insurance?

431
00:15:26,120 --> 00:15:27,050
Of course he did.

432
00:15:28,160 --> 00:15:29,490
Insuring Luan Pingping

433
00:15:29,800 --> 00:15:31,480
was preparation for that day.

434
00:15:34,760 --> 00:15:35,890
If Pingping is gone,

435
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:38,060
we can have another child.

436
00:15:38,800 --> 00:15:40,120
But there is only one Keguang.

437
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:40,480
So

438
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:41,640
I had to find a way

439
00:15:41,640 --> 00:15:42,880
to tie him to me

440
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:46,160
and make sure he never leaves me.

441
00:15:46,520 --> 00:15:47,680
For Luan Keguang,

442
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:49,840
you treated your own child

443
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:50,800
as an ATM.

444
00:15:50,800 --> 00:15:52,080
You have absolutely no humanity

445
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:53,140
and no bottom line.

446
00:15:53,160 --> 00:15:54,820
Pingping is my child with him.

447
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:57,400
What's the point of my life

448
00:15:57,400 --> 00:15:58,760
without Keguang?

449
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:06,280
The evidence to convict
Shen Shuyue is very clear.

450
00:16:06,280 --> 00:16:07,480
But she claims

451
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:09,120
she sent a voice message to Luan Keguang,

452
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:10,250
and he didn't reply.

453
00:16:10,760 --> 00:16:12,480
Luan Keguang said he was asleep

454
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:13,360
and didn't hear it,

455
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:14,600
only seeing it the next day.

456
00:16:14,600 --> 00:16:16,000
But Luan Pingping was already dead.

457
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:17,200
If Luan Keguang

458
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:18,320
didn't know that night

459
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:19,360
and took no action,

460
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:21,480
should he still be held responsible
for Luan Pingping's death?

461
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:23,080
That would be hard to define.

462
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:24,120
First, we need to see if he

463
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:25,250
was actually lying.

464
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,680
I think we can have the police apply

465
00:16:26,680 --> 00:16:28,940
to retrieve the chat app's backend data.

466
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:31,040
If Luan Keguang used the app then

467
00:16:31,480 --> 00:16:33,080
and heard that voice message,

468
00:16:33,080 --> 00:16:34,340
there must be a record.

469
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:36,960
The case is already very clear.

470
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:38,360
But how should we prosecute?

471
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:39,560
Do you have any ideas?

472
00:16:39,760 --> 00:16:41,360
Shen Shuyue's
psychiatric evaluation report

473
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:41,880
is out.

474
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:43,760
She doesn't have a mental illness.

475
00:16:43,760 --> 00:16:44,820
But she has a severe

476
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,290
paranoid personality.

477
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:47,320
According to the evaluation report,

478
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:49,650
she bears full criminal responsibility.

479
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:52,160
This Shen Shuyue dared
to hurt someone in the street.

480
00:16:52,160 --> 00:16:54,160
She poses too high a danger to society.

481
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:55,920
She was completely planning
to perish together.

482
00:16:55,920 --> 00:16:57,080
What about Luan Keguang?

483
00:16:57,080 --> 00:16:58,340
Tell me your thoughts.

484
00:16:58,720 --> 00:17:00,680
Although Luan Keguang
had no intention to kill,

485
00:17:00,680 --> 00:17:01,480
as a father,

486
00:17:01,880 --> 00:17:03,160
his indifference and dereliction of duty

487
00:17:03,160 --> 00:17:05,160
mean he should also bear
corresponding responsibility.

488
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:05,680
Wei,

489
00:17:06,760 --> 00:17:07,760
what do you think?

490
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:08,760
I want

491
00:17:09,560 --> 00:17:11,020
to see Luan Keguang again.

492
00:17:11,040 --> 00:17:13,920
I really didn't know she was going to
murder Pingping that night.

493
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:15,440
Ever since I moved out,

494
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:18,040
she's been sending me videos
of her abusing the child.

495
00:17:18,040 --> 00:17:18,920
Because of that,

496
00:17:18,920 --> 00:17:20,520
I tremble

497
00:17:20,520 --> 00:17:21,760
whenever she messages me now.

498
00:17:21,760 --> 00:17:23,319
Then why didn't you call the police?

499
00:17:23,319 --> 00:17:25,450
She's the child's biological mother.

500
00:17:26,960 --> 00:17:29,420
I don't live with Pingping
and her right now.

501
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:32,300
What if I call the police
and she abandons Pingping,

502
00:17:32,360 --> 00:17:33,320
or beats him even harder

503
00:17:33,320 --> 00:17:34,180
out of revenge?

504
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:35,970
I have to think about my son.

505
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:37,120
You and Shen Shuyue

506
00:17:37,120 --> 00:17:39,240
once owned a house worth 1.8 million,

507
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:40,770
which is marital property.

508
00:17:40,840 --> 00:17:42,240
But you are not divorced.

509
00:17:42,440 --> 00:17:44,280
And all the money from selling the house

510
00:17:44,280 --> 00:17:45,610
went into your account.

511
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:46,320
No,

512
00:17:46,320 --> 00:17:48,320
I pay them child support regularly.

513
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:50,280
You can check my bank statements.

514
00:17:50,280 --> 00:17:51,640
I've never mistreated them.

515
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:52,880
On the night of September 23rd,

516
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:55,160
you told Shen Shuyue on WeChat

517
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:56,480
that you wanted a divorce

518
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:58,880
and told her to earn her own money
to raise Luan Pingping,

519
00:17:58,880 --> 00:17:59,280
right?

520
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:01,280
I was mad at her then.

521
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:02,880
I just said it without thinking.

522
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:04,960
Shen Shuyue called you
multiple times in between,

523
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:05,960
but you didn't answer.

524
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:06,840
An hour later,

525
00:18:07,320 --> 00:18:08,920
she sent you a voice message.

526
00:18:08,920 --> 00:18:11,760
That voice message was clearly
aimed at the insurance premium.

527
00:18:11,760 --> 00:18:11,960
No.

528
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:13,080
How many times do I have to tell you?

529
00:18:13,080 --> 00:18:13,940
I didn't see it.

530
00:18:14,320 --> 00:18:15,120
You're lying.

531
00:18:15,560 --> 00:18:16,640
Not only did you see it,

532
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:17,900
but you also played it.

533
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:19,880
Because once a voice message is played,

534
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:23,210
the file is automatically cached
in the local chat history.

535
00:18:28,280 --> 00:18:29,120
Look closely.

536
00:18:29,560 --> 00:18:30,720
The video Shen Shuyue sent you

537
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:32,320
on the night of the incident

538
00:18:32,320 --> 00:18:35,050
clearly showed a large number
of sleeping pills.

539
00:18:35,320 --> 00:18:36,960
You knew exactly
that Luan Pingping took the pills,

540
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:38,690
yet you didn't call the police.

541
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:39,480
Over the past two years,

542
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:40,880
Shen Shuyue sent you
multiple photos and videos

543
00:18:40,880 --> 00:18:42,880
of her abusing Luan Pingping.

544
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,040
To avoid responsibility,

545
00:18:44,040 --> 00:18:45,400
you just ignored them.

546
00:18:46,240 --> 00:18:47,160
Shen Shuyue is the one who hurt her.

547
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:48,160
What does it have to do with me?

548
00:18:48,160 --> 00:18:49,560
What does it have to do with you?

549
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:51,320
You knew Luan Pingping might die,

550
00:18:51,320 --> 00:18:52,320
but you didn't stop it.

551
00:18:52,320 --> 00:18:53,560
As the child's father,

552
00:18:53,560 --> 00:18:55,820
you have an undeniable responsibility.

553
00:18:59,320 --> 00:19:00,720
Now I'm asking you again,

554
00:19:00,760 --> 00:19:03,620
where exactly were you
on the night of the incident?

555
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:18,600
I need to take a call.

556
00:19:18,600 --> 00:19:20,060
Play by yourself for a bit.

557
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:39,080
I really didn't expect things

558
00:19:39,080 --> 00:19:40,280
to turn out like this.

559
00:19:40,360 --> 00:19:41,960
Did you really not expect it,

560
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:43,600
or did you turn a blind eye

561
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:45,080
and do it on purpose?
